@startuml usecase
' 智能旅游规划系统 · 用例图
' 对应 SRS 3.2 节

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

actor "游客" as Tourist
actor "管理员" as Admin
actor "天气服务" as Weather <<外部系统>>
actor "地图服务" as Map <<外部系统>>
actor "人流量服务" as Traffic <<外部系统>>
actor "活动日历服务" as Event <<外部系统>>
actor "票务 / 酒店服务" as Booking <<外部系统>>
actor "认证服务" as Auth <<外部系统>>

rectangle "智能旅游规划系统" {
  usecase "UC-01\n游客登录与偏好建档" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02\n出行条件录入与校验" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03\n行程自动生成" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04\n行程结果查看" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05\n行程局部调整" as UC05
  usecase "UC-06\n行程保存与分享" as UC06
  usecase "UC-07\n规划反馈" as UC07
  usecase "UC-08\nPOI 与活动数据维护" as UC08
  usecase "UC-09\n推荐策略参数配置" as UC09

  usecase "校验日期/预算/人数" as UCV
  usecase "计算拥挤度指数" as UCC
  usecase "评估天气风险" as UCW
  usecase "估算通勤时长" as UCT
  usecase "插入当地活动" as UCE
}

Tourist --> UC01
Tourist --> UC02
Tourist --> UC03
Tourist --> UC04
Tourist --> UC05
Tourist --> UC06
Tourist --> UC07

Admin --> UC08
Admin --> UC09
Admin --> UC01

UC01 ..> Auth : <<include>>
UC02 ..> UCV : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UCC : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UCW : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UCT : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UCE : <<include>>
UC05 ..> UCT : <<include>>

UCC --> Traffic
UCW --> Weather
UCT --> Map
UCE --> Event
UC03 --> Booking

note right of UC03
  **优先级 P0**
  主流程：条件 → 候选筛选 →
  评分排序 → 贪心装箱 →
  可行性校验 → 预算迭代 →
  1~3 套方案
end note

note bottom of UC05
  **优先级 P1**
  含「撤销」子项（P0）
  预览不落库，保存才生成版本
  —— 见 ADR-005
end note

@enduml
